      {
        "id": 206100,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-11T04:40:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You're walking through the desert when you encounter a turtle on its back. Do you turn the turtle over?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It depends on if he's sunbathing or not, and his 30-min for his stomach are up.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You're walking through a supply depot space station, when you encounter an Adama with a flashlight. What do you do?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I use my flashlight to find a dictionary and look up what an 'Adama' is.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Your friend tells you that the Dark Watch is a better team than the Freedom Five, and Dark Watch Setback has the best power. Will you play a game with your friend?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I marry them. On the spot.</p>",
