      {
        "id": 206101,
        "name": "Lord Flash Fire",
        "username": "Lord_Flash_Fire",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lord_flash_fire/{size}/2071_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-11T12:41:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You're walking through the desert when you encounter a turtle on its back. Do you turn the turtle over?&nbsp;<strong>I turn it over and paint it's shell teal</strong></p>\n<p>You're walking through a supply depot space station, when you encounter an Adama with a flashlight. What do you do?&nbsp;<strong>Google Adama</strong></p>\n<p>Your friend tells you that the Dark Watch is a better team than the Freedom Five&nbsp;<strong>I tell him that's a cool and good opinion, then have a 30 minute discussion about it</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>and Dark Watch Setback has the best power. Will you play a game with your friend? <strong>I immediately discount all opinions my friend had said in the last week, refer him to a better dealer, and make him an anti-hangover meal. And give him a put-punch or two.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
