      {
        "id": 206102,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-11T13:34:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You're walking through the desert when you encounter a turtle on its back. Do you turn the turtle over? &nbsp;<strong>I close my eyes and disbelieve this paltry reality, as turtles are almost universally aquatic creatures and would not be found in a desert. &nbsp;Tortoise, yes. &nbsp;Turtle, no.</strong></p>\n<p>You're walking through a supply depot space station, when you encounter an Adama with a flashlight. What do you do? &nbsp;<strong>I push him into the airlock, as the real Adama should still be aboard the Battlestar known as Galactica.</strong></p>\n<p>Your friend tells you that the Dark Watch is a better team than the Freedom Five, and Dark Watch Setback has the best power. Will you play a game with your friend?</p>\n<p><b>I agree with him on the first point, then proceed to judge his humanity by extolling the virtues of Freedom Six Tempest.</b></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:35:31.823Z",
