      {
        "id": 206103,
        "name": "Ehkrickor",
        "username": "Ehkrickor",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ehkrickor/{size}/2035_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-11T14:23:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We can easily determine who is and who is not a fleshchild by administering a test with questions designed to provide an emotional response:</p>\n<p>You're walking through the desert when you encounter a turtle on its back. Do you turn the turtle over?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I turn the turtle over, several times in my hands to make sure i don't see an Adrinka anywhere. Michael keeps getting himself into weird situations.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You're walking through a supply depot space station, when you encounter an Adama with a flashlight. What do you do?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Make humming noises, if it's dark enough for others to be using flash lights i'm probably using my Lightsaber as a light source (litterally did that the other week when a drunk guy hit a transformer and took out power to my neighborhood, now i have a reputation.)</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Your friend tells you that the Dark Watch is a better team than the Freedom Five, and Dark Watch Setback has the best power. Will you play a game with your friend?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I bring up Phantaskippy's Till Death fan fiction variants because the story is great &amp; if it gets enough attention maybe we can convince Adam to draw them. and we never actually get to the game because meta &amp; fan fiction discussion takes up too much time.</p>",
