        "created_at": "2017-10-11T17:17:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Donner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/48/1903_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Donner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I am a clone.&nbsp; I am not a Biomancer clone.<span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>The site's \"laughing\" emoticon does not convey how loudly I laughed at this.&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>And then I was saddened when I realized that a lot of people aren't even going to get it…&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
